 since 1919 there  will be no grey cup game  the cfl says it's committed to next  season and the hope is  fans will miss the game and come back in  full force in 2021  eric sorensen global news toronto  and that is global national for this  monday i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is the hamlet of  dewinton alberta  just south of calgary we'd love to see  your corner of this country so please  send your photos to viewers at  globalnational.com  thank you for watching and i'll see you  back here tomorrow have a great night
 

